<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95995" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπόγγος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sponge</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πολυτρήτο&lt;&gt;σι τραπέζας ϝίζον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.111
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				22.439
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπόγγῳ ἀμφὶ πρόσωπα καὶ ἄμφω χεῖρ᾽
					ἀπομόργνυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.414
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρώσσων ς. ὤλεσεν γραφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1329
				</span></i>
			; used at the bath, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				15.7
			</span></i>; for cleaning shoes. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				600
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπογγίζω</span>); cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				487b9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				588b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				27.48
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>any spongy substance</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σικυώνης
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Steril.</u>
				221
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ς</span>. the <i>glands</i>
			in the throat, <i>tonsils</i>, from their <i>spongy</i> nature
			and liability to swell, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.140
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήριον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.81
			</span></i>. (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφόγγος</span></b>  is found
			in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>). <i><span class="en">
				144
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				37
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				6.558.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1384.25
			</span></i> (V <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
			</span></i>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπογγιά,
		σπογγίον</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
